# Bundled package reference data: small CSV/JSON files shipped inside pyavs/pyavs/data/
# (see pyproject.toml package-data / MANIFEST.in). Distinct from the external AVS dataset,
# which is never stored in-repo and is configured via pyavs.configure() / PYAVS_DATA_PATH.
!pyavs/data/
!pyavs/data/*.csv
!pyavs/data/*.json
